 "intro": "<p class=\"lede\">The smallest known object of each period, as of November 2026.</p><p class=\"muted\">The June 2009 tables, updated with later finds from the wiki (2013–2018), the <a href=\"https://conwaylife.com/forums/viewtopic.php?t=649\">ConwayLife forum thread</a>, and the site’s own pattern files. […] denotes a flotilla whose parts interact; pseudo-objects made of independent parts aren’t counted. Cells is the minimum population (oscillators, spaceships) or initial population (puffers, which include rakes). Periods and populations were checked by simulating each pattern, except where noted. Objects not found by Luke Bradford are credited, with a link to where they were posted. For the 2008 set in one file, see <a href=\"files.html#period-examples-digits\">Period examples (digits)</a>.</p>",
